{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31736","headline":"送沈秀才下第东归 · 贾岛","name":"送沈秀才下第东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲言恶者谁，悦耳如弹丝。\n直言好者谁，刺耳如长锥。\n沈生才俊秀，心肠无邪欺。\n君子忌苟合，择交如求师。\n毁出疾夫口，腾入礼部闱。\n下第子不耻，遗才人耻之。\n东归家室远，掉辔时参差。\n浙云近吴见，汴柳接楚垂。\n明年春光别，回首不复疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}